---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const h2c = 'mt-10 font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-navy';
const h3c = 'mt-6 font-sans text-lg font-bold text-navy';
const pc = 'mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft';
const ulc = 'mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-ink-soft';
const a = 'text-brass-deep underline underline-offset-2';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy | Levi Henry Group" description="How Levi Henry Group handles your information.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14 lg:pt-20">
      <p data-reveal class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-navy-600">Legal</p>
      <h1 data-reveal class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-navy sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p data-reveal class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-faint">Last updated: 17 August 2026</p>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-line">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14 lg:py-16">
        <p class="rounded border border-line border-l-[3px] border-l-brass bg-paper p-4 text-sm text-ink-soft">
          This policy explains what information Levi Henry Group handles and how. It is written in plain terms; if anything is unclear, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@thelevihenry.com" class={a}>hello@thelevihenry.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p class={pc}>Levi Henry Group ("we", "us", "our") is a consulting, education, and technology services company operated by Levi Henry. This policy applies to <strong class="text-ink">thelevihenry.com</strong> and to the services and communications we provide through it. We are based in Nigeria and work with clients internationally.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>2. Information we collect</h2>
        <h3 class={h3c}>Information you give us</h3>
        <ul class={ulc}>
          <li><strong class="text-ink">Contact details</strong>, such as your name and email address when you use our contact form, email us, or book a call.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink">Message content</strong>: anything you choose to tell us about yourself, your goals, or your business.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink">Purchase and enrolment details</strong>: if you buy, pre-order, or enrol in a product or program, we (or our payment/course providers) collect the information needed to fulfil it.</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class={h3c}>Information collected automatically</h3>
        <ul class={ulc}>
          <li><strong class="text-ink">Technical data</strong>, like your IP address, browser type, device, and pages viewed, recorded in standard server and content-delivery logs to keep the site secure and working.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class={h2c}>3. How we use your information</h2>
        <ul class={ulc}>
          <li>To respond to your enquiries and provide the consulting, education, or technology services you request.</li>
          <li>To deliver products, courses, and pre-orders you sign up for.</li>
          <li>To operate, secure, and improve our website.</li>
          <li>To send you information you have asked for, and to communicate about work in progress.</li>
          <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class={pc}>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not send marketing email to people who have not asked to hear from us.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>4. Cookies &amp; analytics</h2>
        <p class={pc}>Our site does not use advertising or tracking cookies. If we add analytics in the future to understand how the site is used, we will update this policy. Note that fonts are served by Google Fonts, which may receive your IP address as part of delivering those files.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>5. How we share information</h2>
        <p class={pc}>We share information only with the service providers that help us run the site and communicate with you, and only as needed. These currently include:</p>
        <ul class={ulc}>
          <li><strong class="text-ink">Netlify</strong>: website hosting and delivery.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink">Cloudflare</strong>: DNS and email routing.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink">Google</strong>: email and web fonts.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-ink">Resend</strong> and <strong class="text-ink">Airtable</strong>: to deliver resources you request and to record and follow up on your enquiry.</li>
          <li>Payment or course-hosting providers, if and when you make a purchase or enrol.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class={pc}>We may also disclose information if required by law or to protect our rights.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>6. Data retention</h2>
        <p class={pc}>We keep your information only as long as needed for the purposes above (for example, to maintain our correspondence, deliver a service, or meet legal requirements) and then delete or anonymise it.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>7. Security</h2>
        <p class={pc}>We use reputable providers and reasonable measures (including HTTPS across the site) to protect your information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>8. Your rights</h2>
        <p class={pc}>You may ask us to access, correct, or delete the personal information we hold about you, or to stop contacting you. To make a request, email <a href="mailto:hello@thelevihenry.com" class={a}>hello@thelevihenry.com</a> and we will respond within a reasonable time.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>9. Third-party links</h2>
        <p class={pc}>Our site links to external sites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites; please review their policies.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>10. Children's privacy</h2>
        <p class={pc}>Our services are intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 16.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>11. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class={pc}>We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will change the "last updated" date above. Significant changes will be made clear on this page.</p>

        <h2 class={h2c}>12. Contact us</h2>
        <p class={pc}>Questions about this policy or your information? Email <a href="mailto:hello@thelevihenry.com" class={a}>hello@thelevihenry.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
